 r←Test_UC_210(stopFlag batchFlag);⎕TRAP;tempDir;ref;rc;msg;res
⍝ Call ]Cider.ProjectConfig with the path of a project that is not open.
⍝ Used to ignore the argument: it reported on an open project instead, cancelled, or failed when none was open.
 ⎕TRAP←(999 'C' '. ⍝ Deliberate error')(0 'N')
 r←T._Failed

 tempDir←∆GetFolderInTempDir⊃⎕SI
 tempDir ⎕NCOPY⍠('Wildcard' 1)('IfExists' 'Replace')⊢##.CiderConfig.HOME,'/Tests/Test_Alias/*'
 ref←∆GetRefToCommTools
 ref.AddAutomation'Select' 'Select a Cider project:'⍬  ⍝ Only asked when the argument is ignored and several projects are open

 (rc msg res)←∆UCMD'ProjectConfig "',tempDir,'/Project2"'
 →T.GoToTidyUp 0≠rc
 →T.GoToTidyUp~∨/'Project2/cider.config'⍷∊res

 r←T._OK

∆TidyUp:
 ref.Cleanup
 (rc msg)←FilesAndDirs.RmDirByForce tempDir
 msg Assert 0=rc
⍝Done
